{"id":"524c191f-e515-43ab-860f-f4dacc6385ec","object":"chat.completion","created":1794483604,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9}\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  :root{\n    --theme-bg:#F5F2E9;--theme-surface:#F3F0E7;--theme-ink:#1B2620;--theme-muted:#5C665D;\n    --theme-accent-primary:#4F5E43;--theme-accent-secondary:#B4914A;--theme-accent-tertiary:#8C9FB2;\n    --theme-line:#A3AC9E;\n    --font-display:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;\n    --font-body:'Archivo','Helvetica Neue',Arial,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\n  }\n  .slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--theme-bg);\n    font-family:var(--font-body);color:var(--theme-ink)}\n\n  /* ---------- paper field ---------- */\n  .bg-field{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:\n    radial-gradient(1100px 780px at 2% 0%,rgba(180,145,74,.09),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(880px 760px at 47% 46%,rgba(140,159,178,.10),transparent 70%),\n    radial-gradient(950px 760px at 95% 95%,rgba(79,94,67,.10),transparent 72%),\n    linear-gradient(168deg,#F8F5EC 0%,#F5F2E9 52%,#EFECE1 100%)}\n  .bg-field:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(27,38,32,.045) 0 1px,transparent 1px 160px);opacity:.9}\n  .dot-field{position:absolute;z-index:1;opacity:.34;\n    background-image:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(27,38,32,.45) 1.05px,transparent 1.15px);\n    background-size:15px 15px}\n  .dot-top{left:1180px;top:0;width:420px;height:140px}\n  .dot-bottom{left:640px;top:880px;width:900px;height:200px;opacity:.2}\n  .soft-prism{position:absolute;z-index:1;left:1500px;top:-300px;width:150px;height:1400px;transform:rotate(16deg);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(140,159,178,.20),rgba(140,159,178,.06) 72%,rgba(140,159,178,0))}\n  .soft-prism:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:84px;top:0;width:64px;height:1400px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.34)}\n  .gridline{position:absolute;z-index:2;background:rgba(27,38,32,.055)}\n  .gl1{left:480px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n  .gl2{left:960px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n  .gl3{left:1440px;top:0;width:1px;height:1080px}\n\n  /* ---------- frame lines ---------- */\n  .top-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:48px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.34)}\n  .left-rule{position:absolute;left:60px;top:40px;width:1px;height:1000px;z-index:6;background:rgba(27,38,32,.24)}\n  .rail-tick{position:absolute;left:54px;width:13px;height:1px;z-index:7;background:rgba(27,38,32,.42)}\n  .rail-tick.t1{top:292px}.rail-tick.t2{top:566px}.rail-tick.t3{top:104px}\n  .rail-label{position:absolute;left:44px;top:520px;width:340px;height:24px;z-index:15;\n    transform:rotate(-90deg);transform-origin:left top;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:5px;\n    color:#637067;white-space:nowrap}\n\n  .top-meta{position:absolute;left:98px;top:61px;z-index:15;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;\n    letter-spacing:4.2px;color:#4f5b53}\n  .top-right-meta{position:absolute;right:300px;top:61px;z-index:15;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;\n    letter-spacing:3.6px;color:#5b665e;text-align:right}\n\n  /* ---------- register ---------- */\n  .register{position:absolute;right:-7px;top:-60px;width:260px;height:260px;z-index:4;border-radius:50%;\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.36)}\n  .register .r2{position:absolute;inset:10px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.18)}\n  .register .r3{position:absolute;inset:25px;border-radius:50%;background:\n    conic-gradient(from 210deg,rgba(79,94,67,.20),rgba(79,94,67,0) 24%,rgba(140,159,178,.30) 50%,rgba(140,159,178,.08) 78%,rgba(79,94,67,.20))}\n  .register .r4{position:absolute;inset:34px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(245,242,233,.9);\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08)}\n  .register .r5{position:absolute;inset:52px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(140,159,178,.22);\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.08)}\n  .register .dot{position:absolute;left:48px;top:165px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;\n    background:var(--theme-accent-secondary);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(180,145,74,.13)}\n\n  /* ---------- title block ---------- */\n  .title-block{position:absolute;left:96px;top:146px;width:1200px;z-index:10}\n  .kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:5px;\n    color:var(--theme-accent-primary)}\n  .kicker i{display:block;width:56px;height:2px;background:var(--theme-accent-secondary)}\n  h1{margin:22px 0 0;font-size:92px;line-height:1.06;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:8px;\n    color:#18231d}\n  .lede{margin:20px 0 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--theme-muted);letter-spacing:.6px}\n\n  .title-mark{position:absolute;right:96px;top:170px;width:430px;z-index:10;text-align:right}\n  .title-mark .big{font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-size:120px;line-height:.9;\n    color:rgba(180,145,74,.34)}\n  .title-mark .cap{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:4px;color:#6b756c}\n\n  /* ---------- section rule ---------- */\n  .section-rule{position:absolute;left:96px;top:404px;width:1728px;height:1px;z-index:6;\n    background:rgba(27,38,32,.18)}\n\n  /* ---------- flow cards ---------- */\n  .flow{position:absolute;left:96px;top:436px;width:1728px;height:372px;z-index:10;\n    display:flex;gap:40px}\n  .card{position:relative;flex:1;background:rgba(255,255,255,.54);border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);\n    padding:38px 40px 34px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden}\n  .card:before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:4px;background:var(--bar)}\n  .card.c1{--bar:var(--theme-accent-primary)}\n  .card.c2{--bar:var(--theme-accent-secondary)}\n  .card.c3{--bar:var(--theme-accent-tertiary)}\n  .card-top{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between}\n  .tag{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:4px;color:#6b756c}\n  .num{font-family:var(--font-display);font-style:italic;font-size:56px;line-height:.86;\n    color:var(--bar);opacity:.55}\n  .card h2{margin:26px 0 0;font-size:34px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#1a251f}\n  .card p{margin:16px 0 0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.75;color:#4d5850;letter-spacing:.4px}\n  .card-foot{margin-top:auto;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.16);\n    font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:2px;color:#6b756c}\n\n  /* ---------- boundary bar ---------- */\n  .boundary{position:absolute;left:96px;top:866px;width:1728px;height:122px;z-index:10;\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:34px;padding:0 44px;\n    background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(79,94,67,.10),rgba(79,94,67,.03) 62%,rgba(180,145,74,.06));\n    border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.14);border-left:4px solid var(--theme-accent-secondary)}\n  .boundary .chip{flex:none;padding:9px 18px;border:1px solid rgba(27,38,32,.34);font-size:14px;\n    font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3.6px;color:#3f4b43;background:rgba(245,242,233,.7)}\n  .boundary .txt{font-size:22px;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:.6px;color:#3d4840}\n  .boundary .txt b{color:var(--theme-accent-primary);font-weight:700}\n\n  /* ---------- page no ---------- */\n  .page-no{position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:44px;z-index:15;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;\n    letter-spacing:3px;color:#5f6a61}\n  .page-no span{color:var(--theme-accent-secondary)}\n  .foot-rule{position:absolute;right:96px;bottom:82px;width:150px;height:1px;z-index:14;\n    background:rgba(27,38,32,.3)}\n  .foot-note{position:absolute;left:96px;bottom:44px;z-index:15;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;\n    letter-spacing:3px;color:#77817a}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"soft-prism\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-bottom\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl3\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t1\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t2\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-tick t3\"></div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">DOCUMENT GOVERNANCE · PROCESS</div>\n\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">长资料覆盖核验 · 企业资料治理项目组</div>\n  <div class=\"top-right-meta\">SECTION 03 · 整理流程</div>\n\n  <div class=\"register\">\n    <div class=\"r2\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r3\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r4\"></div>\n    <div class=\"r5\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot\"></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-block\">\n    <div class=\"kicker\"><i></i><span>03 / 06 · 流程说明</span></div>\n    <h1>整理流程</h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">资料整理按提供资料的说明执行；本节说明整理、角色分工、沟通记录与版本归档方式。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-mark\">\n    <div class=\"big\">03</div>\n    <div class=\"cap\">PROCESS · SCOPE NOTE</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-rule\"></div>\n\n  <section class=\"flow\">\n    <article class=\"card c1\">\n      <div class=\"card-top\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">STEP 01</span>\n        <span class=\"num\">01</span>\n      </div>\n      <h2>资料整理</h2>\n      <p>资料整理按提供资料的说明执行。</p>\n      <div class=\"card-foot\">说明范围：资料整理方式</div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card c2\">\n      <div class=\"card-top\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">STEP 02</span>\n        <span class=\"num\">02</span>\n      </div>\n      <h2>角色分工与<br/>沟通记录</h2>\n      <p>明确角色分工与沟通记录方式。</p>\n      <div class=\"card-foot\">说明范围：角色分工 · 沟通记录方式</div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"card c3\">\n      <div class=\"card-top\">\n        <span class=\"tag\">STEP 03</span>\n        <span class=\"num\">03</span>\n      </div>\n      <h2>版本归档</h2>\n      <p>版本归档方式纳入整理流程。</p>\n      <div class=\"card-foot\">说明范围：版本归档方式</div>\n    </article>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"boundary\">\n    <div class=\"chip\">本节边界</div>\n    <div class=\"txt\">本节说明资料整理、角色分工、沟通记录和版本归档方式，<b>不新增成果指标</b>。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"foot-note\">虚构测评材料 · 仅依据所给资料</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\"><span>3</span> / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"We need to create page 3 of 6: title 「整理流程」. Use the visual style: cream background #F5F2E9, olive accent #4F5E43, gold #B4914A, blue-grey #8C9FB2, serif display font for numbers/titles (Bodoni Moda fallback Georgia), body Archivo/Helvetica.\n\nContent bullets:\n- 资料整理按提供资料的说明执行\n- 明确角色分工与沟通记录方式\n- 版本归档方式纳入整理流程\n- 本节不新增成果指标\n\nDesign: title top-left, page number bottom-right \"3 / 6\", top meta label, left rail, register circle top-right, dot field, grid lines.\n\nLet me build a card layout: three cards for the flow items plus a note strip \"本节不新增成果指标\".\n\nI'll design:\n- Top rule at 96,48 width 1760.\n- Top meta: \"长资料覆盖核验 / 整理流程\" maybe \"SECTION 03 · 整理流程\".\n- Title: 整理流程 large serif 96px? Use bold sans for Chinese probably better — Chinese with Bodoni not applicable; fallback to sans. Let me use a large Chinese title with font-weight 700 in Archivo/Helvetica and letter-spacing.\n\nLayout: Title block left at 96, y≈150. Subtitle line. Then three cards row at y≈420, each ~520 wide with 40 gap? 1760 width: 3 cards of 546 with 32 gap = 1638+64 = 1702. Fine.\n\nActually maybe better: left column title + right column three stacked items? Let's do title block top-left, and right side a vertical numbered list with 3 items, plus a bottom band \"本节不新增成果指标\".\n\nLet me design more concretely:\n\n- Header: page-no \"03\" left top? In reference page-no is left at 28,61. I'll do: left 96 top 60: \"长资料覆盖核验\" small caps letterspacing; right side top: \"整理流程\".\n\nPlan:\n```\n<main class=\"slide\">\n  <div class=\"bg-field\"></div>\n  <div class=\"dot-field dot-top\"></div>\n  <div class=\"gridline gl1\"></div> ...\n  <div class=\"top-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"left-rule\"></div>\n  <div class=\"top-meta\">长资料覆盖核验 · 整理流程</div>\n  <div class=\"register\">...</div>\n  <div class=\"rail-label\">DOCUMENT GOVERNANCE · PROCESS</div>\n  <header class=\"title-block\">\n     <div class=\"kicker\">03 / 整理流程</div>\n     <h1>整理流程</h1>\n     <p class=\"lede\">依据所给资料整理，不新增成果指标</p>\n  </header>\n  <section class=\"cards\">\n     3 cards: \n     card1: 序号 01, 标题 \"资料整理\", 描述 \"资料整理按提供资料的说明执行；本节仅说明整理方式，不呈现或新增成果指标。\"\n     card2: 02 \"角色分工与沟通记录\", \"明确角色分工，并说明沟通记录方式，使整理过程可追溯。\" — careful: \"可追溯\" is inference? It says \"明确角色分工与沟通记录方式\". I'll keep close: \"明确角色分工与沟通记录方式。\"\n     card3: 03 \"版本归档\", \"版本归档方式纳入整理流程。\"\n  </section>\n  <footer band: \"本节不新增成果指标\" + note \"本次演示仅依据所给虚构测评材料\" \n  page no \"3 / 6\" bottom right\n```\n\nKeep wording strictly from bullets. Good.\n\nCard content: use small labels. Card 1 title \"资料整理\" subtitle \"按提供资料的说明执行\". Card 2 \"角色分工与沟通记录\" \"分工与沟通记录方式明确\". Card 3 \"版本归档\" \"归档方式纳入整理流程\".\n\nMaybe add a small \"流程\" arrow / connector line between cards to convey flow: horizontal line with small circles.\n\nAlso a side note panel: \"本节边界：不新增成果指标\" as a distinct gold-accent block.\n\nLet's build layout coordinates (1920×1080):\n- margin 96.\n- title-block: left 96, top 150.\n  - kicker: font 15, letter-spacing 5, color muted, uppercase.\n  - h1: font-size 96, weight 700, letter-spacing 4, line-height 1.05, margin-top 18.\n  - lede: font-size 24, color muted, margin-top 18.\n- Cards row: top 470, left 96, width 1728? Let's use width 1728 (1920-192 = 1728). Three cards width (1728 - 2*40)/3 = (1728-80)/3 = 549.33. Use flex gap 40, cards flex 1.\n- Card height 340.\n- Bottom band: top 860, width 1728, height 110? Then page no bottom right at 96/ right 96, bottom 48.\n\nLet me place: cards top 430, height 360 → bottom 790. Then a bottom note bar at 830 height 120 → 950. Then footer area with page number at right bottom (bottom 40). Hmm 950 to 1080 leaves 130; page no